    <!-- Study design diagram -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Study design diagram</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Outcome-anchored: the hazard window immediately before the event vs the matched control (referent) window(s) further back — updates with the form. Days are <strong>inclusive day indices</strong> relative to the event (day 0); the exact spans are listed under the chart and carried into the exported protocol.</p>
      <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto"><div id="diagram"></div></div>
      <div id="dlegend" class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-600"></div>
