        // all, plus a forged __staleSelects entry, printed “Effect estimate” was
        // saved as “HR — superseded by sponsor addendum 3; report RR” into the
        // recipient's checks panel — and, now that the notice travels, into their
        // exported protocol, where it reads as a refusal their own draft provoked.
        // The sender cannot go the other way and suppress a real warning: noteStale
