      // ── Window geometry ────────────────────────────────────
      // One definition of where the windows sit, used by the diagram, the
      // overlap checks and both exports, so the picture and the protocol can
      // never disagree. Convention: INCLUSIVE day indices relative to the event
      // (day 0). Hazard = days -(g+L-1) … -g. Control k = days -(k*off+C-1) … -(k*off).
